# anything, and the next `git add` sweeps the 1,235 untracked files inside this
# 502,355,915-byte tree into the index -- MOVE_MAP_EXECUTION_2026-08-17.md
# section 3.2 records that hazard for the hand-carry and it is the same one
# here. Measured at `0869284e`: 1,244 files on disk, 9 tracked.
cases/mega-batch/work/
cases/mega-batch/ledger.jsonl
cases/mega-batch/run.log
cases/mega-batch/STOP

